==German==

===Etymology===
{{lit|when [[Easter]] and [[Pentecost]] fall on the same day}}. By definition, Pentecost always falls seven weeks after Easter. Cf. {{cog|nl|als Pasen en Pinksteren op een dag vallen}}.

